        "chunk_title": "Programme Information",
        "chunk_order": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "category": "overview",
      "field": "career_pathway",
      "value": "It provides a new and exciting career pathway if you are just starting out in industry or are already working there by fusing blended learning at the University of Limerick with real-world application and learning in the field.",
